5,1,1,talk,Servas,,"It is a pleasure to be with you all. To ensure we build upon our past, I wish to look into the outcomes of the last three internal rollouts and the record of cross-unit standardization efforts.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
