7,1,1,talk,Sakura,,Hi everyone! I'm so excited! I want to know about the network coverage at customer plants and the in-house developer availability. I wonder if those will be the tricky parts!,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I will look into the misrouted deliveries in the incident logs and the time lost to copying existing records. We need to understand the actual daily losses before making a decision.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I will examine the staffing of the coordination group and the handling of vendor queries. It is essential to understand the actual human resource capacity before we commit to any new project.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,"It seems we have a very comprehensive plan. Each of us is looking at a different angle of the business, which will provide a balanced perspective. I am content with these choices.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree. It feels like we've covered a lot of the bases. I'll stick with my choices then.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
