14,1,2,talk,Asuka,,I agree. The current division of labor is efficient and minimizes overlap. I will proceed with my investigation into the staffing and vendor query handling.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Servas,,"Since we are all in agreement, I believe we have reached a consensus for this round. I shall wait for the findings to be revealed so we may discuss them with a clear mind.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
